it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:15.114 --> 00:00:18.951 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:18.951 --> 00:00:22.421
Been another week in our ongoing
John Carpenter hellscape,

00:00:22.421 --> 00:00:24.990
