by growing a mustache

00:10:16.382 --> 00:10:19.184
and riding a penny-farthing
to an artisanal pickle store.

00:10:19.184 --> 00:10:22.121
"And this is --
this is a lot for a pickle.

00:10:22.121 --> 00:10:23.289
You guys, this better be --

00:10:23.289 --> 00:10:24.589
These are
pretty expensive pickles."

00:10:24.589 --> 00:10:26.725
And this isn't the first --
"It's a good pic--

00:10:26.725 --> 00:10:29.461
I'm just saying it's a lot --
it's a lot for a pickle."

00:10:29.461 --> 00:10:31.062
This isn't the first time
Trump has made it clear

00:10:31.062 --> 00:10:32.431
he doesn't care about Americans

00:10:32.431 --> 00:10:33.832
who live in states
he didn't win.

00:10:33.832 --> 00:10:36.334
Remember he also wanted to
cut federal aid to California

00:10:36.334 --> 00:10:37.770
during the wildfires last year,

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:39.538
and a former
Homeland Security official

00:10:39.538 --> 00:10:41.473
said Trump demanded
FEMA pull funding

00:10:41.473 --> 00:10:43.976
because "California
didn't support him."

00:10:43.976 --> 00:10:46.278
Just a few weeks ago,
he ordered federal agencies

00:10:46.278 --> 00:10:48.747
to cut funding to what he called
anarchist jurisdictions

00:10:48.747 --> 00:10:51.116
like New York, Seattle,
and Washington, D.C.

00:10:51.116 --> 00:10:53.352
Trump only cares about the
health and safety of Americans

00:10:53.352 --> 00:10:55.053
when it can help him
politically,

00:10:55.053 --> 00:10:57.422
which is why, for example,
he's repeatedly claimed

00:10:57.422 --> 00:10:59.525
a COVID vaccine
is right around the corner,

00:10:59.525 --> 00:11:01.593
even though experts say
that's not true.

00:11:01.593 --> 00:11:03.829
-We remain on track
to deliver a vaccine

00:11:03.829 --> 00:11:08.467
before the end of the year and
maybe even before November 1st.

00:11:08.467 --> 00:11:10.035
We think we can probably have it

00:11:10.035 --> 00:11:12.438
sometime during
the month of October.

00:11:12.438 --> 00:11:14.807
This could have taken
two or three years,

00:11:14.807 --> 00:11:16.742
and instead it's going to be --
[ Chuckles ]

00:11:16.742 --> 00:11:20.078
It's gonna be done
in a very short period of time.

00:11:20.078 --> 00:11:23.849
Could even have it
during the month of October.

00:11:23.849 --> 00:11:27.586
We're gonna have a vaccine in a
matter of -- a matter of weeks.

00:11:27.586 --> 00:11:31.190
It could be four weeks.
It could be eight weeks.

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:33.192
-Could be four weeks.
Could be eight weeks.

00:11:33.192 --> 00:11:34.960
He talks about
a life-saving vaccine

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:37.095
the way he probably talked
to the electrician

00:11:37.095 --> 00:11:39.398
who wanted to get paid
for wiring Trump Tower.

00:11:39.398 --> 00:11:41.600
"Mr. Trump, we sent you
the invoice months ago."

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:42.868
"And I'm gonna pay you, Tony.

00:11:42.868 --> 00:11:44.636
Could be four weeks.
Could be eight weeks."

00:11:44.636 --> 00:11:47.072
Also, experts have repeatedly
said it's highly unlikely

00:11:47.072 --> 00:11:49.274
a vaccine could be available
by October.

00:11:49.274 --> 00:11:52.077
I think Trump might be confusing
a coronavirus vaccine

00:11:52.077 --> 00:11:54.279
with DQ's Pumpkin Pie Blizzard.

00:11:54.279 --> 00:11:57.282
"We're very close, very close
to having -- having a vaccine.

00:11:57.282 --> 00:11:59.785
The scientists are telling me
it will have, uh --

00:11:59.785 --> 00:12:02.287
it will have real --
real pumpkin in it,

00:12:02.287 --> 00:12:04.089
and, of course,
it will be topped

00:12:04.089 --> 00:12:06.058
with, uh, whipped cream,
which, uh --

00:12:06.058 --> 00:12:08.727
Dr. Fauci,
I believe you were saying --

00:12:08.727 --> 00:12:13.766
would provide an extra layer
of protection against the virus.

00:12:13.766 --> 00:12:17.436
He's covering his face.
That is scientist for 'yes.'"

00:12:17.436 --> 00:12:20.472
Yesterday, the CDC director,
Dr. Robert Redfield,

00:12:20.472 --> 00:12:22.240
went before Congress
and made clear

00:12:22.240 --> 00:12:24.777
that even if a vaccine is
available for healthcare workers

00:12:24.777 --> 00:12:26.978
and at-risk groups
by the end of the year,

00:12:26.978 --> 00:12:29.648
it won't be broadly available
to the public at large

00:12:29.648 --> 00:12:32.150
until summer or fall of 2021.

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:37.656
-I think there will be a vaccine
that initially will be available

00:12:37.656 --> 00:12:40.725
sometime between
November and December.

00:12:40.725 --> 00:12:44.629
But very limited supply
and will have to be prioritized.

00:12:44.629 --> 00:12:46.865
If you're asking me when is it
going to be generally available

00:12:46.865 --> 00:12:49.734
to the American public
so we can begin

00:12:49.734 --> 00:12:54.273
to take advantage of vaccine
to get back to our regular life,

00:12:54.273 --> 00:12:57.709
I think we're probably
looking at third --

00:12:57.709 --> 00:13:02.214
late second quarter,
third quarter 2021.

00:13:02.214 --> 00:13:05.083
-Oh, man, now I got to rescind
all those invitations I sent out

00:13:05.083 --> 00:13:07.353
for a December celebratory
post-COVID orgy.

00:13:07.353 --> 00:13:09.221
Still, you know,
it's probably better to do it

00:13:09.221 --> 00:13:10.922
in the second or third quarter
next year.

00:13:10.922 --> 00:13:12.424
You know, tax reasons.

00:13:12.424 --> 00:13:14.827
Anyway, the point is, experts
agree a safe, effective vaccine

00:13:14.827 --> 00:13:17.229
will very likely arrive,
and we have to be realistic

00:13:17.229 --> 00:13:19.798
about the fact that things
aren't just going to instantly

00:13:19.798 --> 00:13:22.935
revert to normal before then or
even after there's a vaccine.

00:13:22.935 --> 00:13:24.970
We still need to practice
public-health measures

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:27.139
like hand-washing,
social distancing,

00:13:27.139 --> 00:13:29.375
avoiding large crowds
and especially mask wearing.

00:13:29.375 --> 00:13:32.111
We know universal mask wearing
can be extremely effective,

00:13:32.111 --> 00:13:34.479
as Redfield made clear
in his testimony,

00:13:34.479 --> 00:13:35.848
which is why it sucks

00:13:35.848 --> 00:13:37.883
that we have a president
who says stuff like this.

00:13:37.883 --> 00:13:39.918
-A lot of people
don't want to wear masks.

00:13:39.918 --> 00:13:42.320
There are a lot of people who
think that masks are not good.

00:13:42.320 --> 00:13:44.289
And there are a lot of people
that as an example --

00:13:44.289 --> 00:13:45.591
-Who are those people?

00:13:45.591 --> 00:13:47.092
-I'll tell you
who those people are.

00:13:47.092 --> 00:13:49.027
Waiters. They come over,
and they serve you,

00:13:49.027 --> 00:13:50.496
and they have a mask.

00:13:50.496 --> 00:13:52.131
And I saw it the other day
where they were serving me.

00:13:52.131 --> 00:13:53.865
And they're playing with a mask.

00:13:53.865 --> 00:13:56.568
I'm not blaming them.
I'm just saying what happens.

00:13:56.568 --> 00:13:58.937
They're playing with a mask,
and so the mask is over,

00:13:58.937 --> 00:14:00.806
and they're touching it

00:14:00.806 --> 00:14:02.607
and then
they're touching the plate.

00:14:02.607 --> 00:14:04.376
That can't be good.

00:14:04.376 --> 00:14:07.446
The concept of a mask is good,
but it also does --

00:14:07.446 --> 00:14:09.047
You're constantly touching it.

00:14:09.047 --> 00:14:11.383
You're touching your face.
You're touching plates.

00:14:11.383 --> 00:14:13.852
There are people that
don't think masks are good.

00:14:13.852 --> 00:14:15.854
-All right, first of all,
the only people who don't think

00:14:15.854 --> 00:14:18.090
masks are good are ass [bleep]
who think they're standing up

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:21.026
for freedom by giving a teenager
a hard time at Costco.

00:14:21.026 --> 00:14:23.895
"Don't tread on me...
Madison!"

00:14:23.895 --> 00:14:26.865
Second, you think waiters
don't want to wear masks?

00:14:26.865 --> 00:14:29.768
I'm pretty sure they would wear
masks even without a pandemic.

00:14:29.768 --> 00:14:32.103
Then you wouldn't see
all their facial expressions

00:14:32.103 --> 00:14:33.872
when people ask
for substitutions.

00:14:33.872 --> 00:14:36.508
"Can I get the Greek salad,

00:14:36.508 --> 00:14:38.043
feta on the side, add quinoa,

00:14:38.043 --> 00:14:40.179
a tiny amount
of balsamic vinaigrette,

00:14:40.179 --> 00:14:42.080
replace the cucumbers
with carrots,

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:43.749
and then switch them
back to cucumbers

00:14:43.749 --> 00:14:45.050
and add the grilled chicken?

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:46.384
But instead of grilled,
can it be baked?

00:14:46.384 --> 00:14:48.120
And instead of chicken,
can it be tofu,

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:49.754
but can you shape it
into a chicken?

00:14:49.754 --> 00:14:51.690
Thank you, Madison."

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:53.825
What the President said
about discounting deaths

00:14:53.825 --> 00:14:56.695
in so-called blue states was not
just another Trump gaffe.

00:14:56.695 --> 00:14:59.364
It was an honest articulation
of his beliefs

00:14:59.364 --> 00:15:01.133
and the beliefs
of the movement he leads.

00:15:01.133 --> 00:15:04.103
The same goes for Barr,
comparing lockdowns to slavery

00:15:04.103 --> 00:15:05.938
and wanting to charge people
with sedition.

00:15:05.938 --> 00:15:08.207
It's an unhinged political
movement that sees anyone

00:15:08.207 --> 00:15:10.208
who doesn't support them
as illegitimate

00:15:10.208 --> 00:15:11.910
and wants
to dismantle democracy.

00:15:11.910 --> 00:15:14.746
And if that happens,
we'll all have to move to Europe

00:15:14.746 --> 00:15:17.782
to escape the Trump heat ray
and live with the Ewoks

00:15:17.782 --> 00:15:19.451
in one of those...
-Forest cities.

00:15:19.451 --> 00:15:23.655
-Yub nub, yub nub.
This has been A" Closer Look."

